      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351AverageFixedPair\n#check TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight\n#check TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_fixed_pair\n#print axioms TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_fixed_pair\n",
      "stream_text": "TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile)\n  (A : ↥(TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarCore P)) (hstar : star A = A)\n  (hE : ↑A ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarPolarRightAlgebra P) :\n  (TGLV350.Regular.scalarClosedTomita P) ⟨TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, ⋯⟩ =\n      TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∧\n    ∃ (hF : TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P),\n      ↑(TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjoint P) ⟨TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, hF⟩ =\n        TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A\n'TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\nTGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_fixed_pair (P : TGLExt.SiteProfile) (δ : ℝ) (hδ : 0 < δ) :\n  ∃ A,\n    ↑↑A = star (TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ) * TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage P δ ∧\n      (TGLV350.Regular.scalarClosedTomita P) ⟨TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, ⋯⟩ =\n          TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∧\n        ∃ (hF : TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∈ TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P),\n          ↑(TGLV350.Regular.scalarTomitaAdjoint P) ⟨TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, hF⟩ =\n            TGLV350.Regular.scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A\n'TGLV350.Regular.regularAverage_square_fixed_pair' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n"
    },
