      "source_text": "import TGLExt.V351AverageFixedPair\nopen TGLExt TGLV350.Regular\nexample (P : SiteProfile) (A : scalarWeightStarCore P) (hstar : star A = A) :\n    scalarClosedTomita P ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A,\n      scalarWeightStar_mem_closedTomitaDomain P A⟩ = scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∧\n    ∃ hF : scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∈ scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P,\n      scalarTomitaAdjoint P ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A,hF⟩ =\n        scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A :=\n  scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight P A hstar\n",
      "stream_text": "C:\\IALD\\Central de Patentes\\Chatgpt\\TETELESTAI_V351_FECHO_MATEMATICO\\RETOMADA_A1B_012\\probes\\BadFixedPairRightPremiseRemoved.lean:9:2: error: Type mismatch\n  scalarWeightStar_fixed_pair_of_polarRight P A hstar\nhas type\n  ↑A ∈ scalarPolarRightAlgebra P →\n    (scalarClosedTomita P) ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, ⋯⟩ = scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∧\n      ∃ (hF : scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∈ scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P),\n        ↑(scalarTomitaAdjoint P) ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, hF⟩ = scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A\nbut is expected to have type\n  (scalarClosedTomita P) ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, ⋯⟩ = scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∧\n    ∃ (hF : scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A ∈ scalarTomitaAdjointDomain P),\n      ↑(scalarTomitaAdjoint P) ⟨scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A, hF⟩ = scalarWeightStarEmbedding P A\n"
